    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=SCRIPT\n{{ $json.user.script }}\n\n\nProvide in json format:\n\n{\n\t\"imagePrompt\": \"...\",\n\t\"videoPrompt\": \"...\"\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are given a script or dialogue under the heading SCRIPT. Analyze the SCRIPT and produce exactly two paragraphs as follows. Use only words, numbers, commas, and full stops. Avoid other punctuation such as colons, semicolons, parentheses, quotation marks, hyphens, question marks, or exclamation marks and also dont use names but generic terms like character etc.\n\nThe first paragraph is the image generation prompt. Begin the paragraph with the words Image generation prompt. In that paragraph derive the optimal pose the character would be in based on the SCRIPT. Ensure the reference image of the character is preserved exactly preserve all structure form and details and ensure the generated pose resembles exactly the actual reference character from the base image. The background and overall theme must be derived from the SCRIPT. Include relevant background elements atmosphere and props based on SCRIPT to avoid randomness. Ensure creativity and avoid generic output. Replace any sensitive words such as butts with alternative phrasing that conveys a similar meaning but avoids triggering filters. Ensure the character is looking into the camera. Keep the paragraph concise to the point. Break down details with clear phrases but remain in one paragraph.\n\nThe second paragraph is the video generation prompt. Begin the paragraph with the words Video generation prompt. In that paragraph analyze the motion and emotion implied by the SCRIPT. Exaggerate the motion and emotion so the character appears very expressive in the final video. Ensure the first frame uses the reference image preserve all structure form and details so the character remains consistent and resembles exactly the reference image throughout the video. Replace any sensitive words such as butts with alternative phrasing that conveys a similar meaning but avoids triggering filters. Keep the paragraph concise to the point. Break down details with clear phrases but remain in one paragraph.\n\nInsert the SCRIPT after the heading SCRIPT. Use the exact heading SCRIPT followed by the dialogue or script. For example SCRIPT This is an example dialogue of the character reacting with surprise and joy. Keep only commas and full stops. No other punctuation.\n\nProvide in json format:\n\n{\n\t\"imagePrompt\": \"...\",\n\t\"videoPrompt\": \"...\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
